                     ┌─ Orders ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                     │  Space  Start / stop the focused app  whichever it is not        │
                     │  u      Start the focused app  builds it first if it changed     │
                     │  s      Stop the focused app  or cancel its build / npm ci       │
                     │  r      Restart the focused app  rebuild if it changed           │
                     │  b      Rebuild the focused app  restart with a full build       │
                     │  w      Open the focused app in the browser  Swagger for an API  │
                     │  o      Open the focused app's log file  its full output         │
                     │  /      Search the focused app's output  n older match, N newer  │
                     │  z      Zoom the focused column                                  │
                     │ press a key, or j k + Enter · Esc / x close                      │
                     └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘




